# COMPOSER-SUPER-ARROWS at a permission question. fx v0.0.16 decodes a held
# Left, Right, Home or End to a composer move (modifiedArrowAction,
# escape_parser.zig:73-108@481104fd). At a choice with no amendment open it
# is no key of the choice's (`else => {}`, input_approval_runtime.zig:128);
# in an amendment line_start and draft_start are `.cursor_home` and line_end
# and draft_end `.cursor_end` (approvalDraftActionFromShortcut,
# src/ui/input/runtime.zig:75-96): the draft's start and end
# (approval_amendment.zig:84-92), Shift held or not. Each key at choice 2;
# then the amendment on choice 1, each key followed by its own letter, from
# two cells in from where the letter before left the caret.
# The turns, the workspace and the settings are approvals.cap's.
fx: gateway approvals-fx.json
xfx: gateway approvals-xfx.json
work approvals-ws
fx: seed approvals-fx-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 3
type edit the files
key Enter
wait 3
key Down
wait 0.4
snap down
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 44
wait 0.4
snap super-left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 31 33 44
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-super-left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 43
wait 0.4
snap super-right
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 35 48
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-home
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 46
wait 0.4
snap super-end
key Up
wait 0.4
key Tab
wait 0.4
type ab cd ef
key Left Left Left Left
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 44
wait 0.4
type z
wait 0.4
snap amend-super-left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 43
wait 0.4
type y
wait 0.4
snap amend-super-right
key Left Left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 31 33 44
wait 0.4
type x
wait 0.4
snap amend-ctrl-super-left
key Right Right
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 31 31 43
wait 0.4
type w
wait 0.4
snap amend-alt-super-right
key Left Left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 35 48
wait 0.4
type v
wait 0.4
snap amend-ctrl-home
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 35 46
wait 0.4
type u
wait 0.4
snap amend-ctrl-end
key Left Left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 48
wait 0.4
type t
wait 0.4
snap amend-super-home
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 39 46
wait 0.4
type s
wait 0.4
snap amend-super-end
key Left Left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 32 48
wait 0.4
type r
wait 0.4
snap amend-shift-home
key -H 1b 5b 34 3b 35 7e
wait 0.4
type q
wait 0.4
snap amend-tilde-ctrl-end
